# C++ style for csrc/. Enforced by pre-commit so it is not a thing anyone has to remember.
#
# `NamespaceIndentation: All` is the operator's explicit request (V45): the body of a
# `namespace X {` is indented. LLVM's default is `None`, which is why the first version of
# csrc/ was flat.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
Standard: c++17
ColumnLimit: 100
IndentWidth: 4
AccessModifierOffset: -2
NamespaceIndentation: All
IndentPPDirectives: BeforeHash
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: Inline
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
SortIncludes: CaseSensitive
